Z||000002||Cheever3000||08-16-2001||11:20 PM||||Chill, my man.  <BR>For resizing the pics you gotta have photo editing software (if I'm wrong, somebody speak up quick).  I have MS-Picture-It-2001-Platinum, but when I have film processed at Wally World or the grocery store and ask for it on CD, that comes with software too.  There are instructions for saving the pics at certain sizes.<BR>For smilies, Cliff has some.  When you are in the screen where you're typing your post, look to your left under "Your Reply:".  You'll see the "Smilies Legend" button to click.  Up pops a window with various selections.  Otherwise, you have to copy any good ones you find on other forums etc and upload them with PIP.<P>Cool?<BR>||||reg||1
